Hi,

libgit2 was previously switched from http_parser to llhttp and then back to
http_parser after it was discovered that llhttp was tied to nodejs reducing
the portability of llhttp.

Luckily, this entanglement has been fixed now and llhttp is available for all
of Debian's architectures [1]. Thus, unless I'm missing something, I think it's
safe to switch libgit2 back to llhttp.

Thanks,
Adrian

> [1] https://buildd.debian.org/status/package.php?p=llhttp&suite=sid

